4599   *      READ TABLE lt_nits_all WITH KEY stcd1 = t_stcd1-stcd1.
4600         IF sy-subrc EQ 0.
4601   * Check if Nit
4602           MOVE-CORRESPONDING lt_nits_lfa1_total TO lt_nits_all.
